// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
// SendOffString :
"P3345020750" "Great. First off, here's some information about the current situation, well, at least, <i>part</i> of the situation. Statesman has gone missing, probably off flying somewhere to clear his mind. Can't say I blame him, after all, Alexis was his daughter and all.<br><br>Manticore is kinda on the outs with, well, <i>everyone</i> right now. Malaise, like I said, is being held in a safe house. Manticore insists that there's more to the plot, but Ms. Liberty doubts that. She thinks Malaise's motive was revenge. You're the one who's going to talk to the freak to try to find out what's going on. Everyone else is too invested in this whole thing; Liberty for her mom, Psyche for the fact that he was mind-linked to her.<br><br>Anyway, here's the location of the safe house. Meet up with Ms. Liberty to get a rundown of the current situation."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3416145794" "Interrogate Malaise"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3698536392" "They're waiting on you, {HeroName}."
// TaskTitle :
"P1391944144" "<color deepskyblue>Masterpiece</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3726005631" "<color deepskyblue>Part 1: The Dive</color>"

