// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4214854598" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Please be careful dear.<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>The world is a big place.<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You want to rule it all.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>But the essential rule still applies.<t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>If you want to rule the world, it'll just rule you.<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You say it's lonely here.<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>The ones you've loved are gone.<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>The world could be better.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>But why did you bother trying?<t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>If you want to rule the world, it'll just rule you.<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Destiny and love, you think you own it all.<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod> You've got your plans, they always work.<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Leave it to yourself, it's all you say.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You think you can do it yourself, but remember,<t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>If you want to rule the world, it'll just rule you.<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You say that life's unkind.<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You wanted something else.<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>But baby, you made this choice.<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>You chose to change it all.<t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>If you want to rule the world, it'll just rule you."
