"P3571567476" "Now we die..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P194914344" "Ms. Liberty"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3047987223" "<t=10 d=5 em no>I won't tell you again, Manticore. Get -out-.<t=10 d=5>Just like you protected my mother, Manticore?!<t=10 d=5 em point>Is that all you have to say for yourself? That my mom's death was a 'mistake'?!<t=10 d=5 em disagree>-No-. You're going to interrogate Blitz. Psyche and Aurora will handle Malaise while {HeroName} interrogates him. <t=3 d=5>Then you'll have to go through me if you want to see Malaise. We will keep Psyche safe, Manticore.<t=8 d=5 em point>And we'll do a better job of protecting her than you did with my mom.<t=10 d=5>{HeroName}, I'm sorry you had to see that. Let's go over the situation."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1088294622" "Manticore"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3388435579" "<t=5 d=5><t=10 d=5 em disagree>Listen, kid, I'm here to protect my wife. You don't tell me where to go.<t=10 d=5 em no>That was a mistake. One that won't happen again..<t=10 d=5>There's nothing more to say. Now, are you going to let me through?<t=15 d=5 em laugh>I was fighting crime when you were still in grade school. I'm going through.<t=15 d=5>...Tch. It's on -you- if something happens to her."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3494022729" "Sister Psyche"
