// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3160135311" "Thanks for coming, {HeroName}. Malaise is all yours to interrogate."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2358754453" "<t=5 d=5>{HeroName}, you have to get to the security terminal and turn off the speaker system!<t=5 d=5>Aurora and I will shield you, but we can't help the others!"
