"P23036212" "Well, things are getting a little too interesting now."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1575109" "Family Guard"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2074474352" "Ice this mook!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1137647043" "We got company, take 'em down!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3142022301" "You law-makin' types ain't allowed in here!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2505743164" "You made a big mistake comin' here, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1924842779" "We make the laws around here, not you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1711305430" "You ain't gettin' outta here alive!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P1431431864" "Mercedes Sheldon"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3402121986" "You're not going to stop me from getting to Sonata!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2713884008" "{HeroName}, you're a sight for sore eyes!"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P1522919063" "So, wait. What are YOU doing here anyway?"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_NAME :
"P566383105" "Marcone Underboss"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2620012560" "Marcone Gunner"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3915048246" "Listen blondie, you're cute and all, but you ain't gonna get to Johnny."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3770515318" "WHY is EVERY mook with super powers here today?!"
