"P1598637302" "You rescued Mercedes Sheldon!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3208701531" "Johnny Sonata"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4077364833" "<t=5 d=5>You got guts comin' here kid. I haven't had any heroes tryin' to walk in here, in, well...<t=5 d=5>I ain't EVER had a hero try to walk in here and tell me how to run things.<t=5 d=5>Now, I got this fancy artifact here, one that Miss Sheldon is here to recover. I say I could beat ya with it.<t=2 d=5>But I ain't gonna waste this on you.<t=1 d=5>BOYS!<t=5 d=5>Show {HeroName} what we do to uninvited guests!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P407066917" "What am I paying you people for?! Take them down!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1598833347" "You've gotta be kiddin' me! You guys are getting' rolled!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2130029812" "<t=5 d=5>You must got a lot ridin' on this, kid.<t=5 d=5>Now, if I was a fair man, I'd say you and me would have ourselves a fight, one on one.<t=5 d=5>But my mother, God rest her soul, always taught me never to play fair!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P961920741" "Alright! Alright,you made your point kid! I'll tell you what you wanna know."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3684668976" "What am I PAYING you IDIOTS for?!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1749955530" "<shout>We're on it, Johnny!"

