// Dialog :
"P2309687853" "You defeated Hardcase!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3600697871" "You've found out who is behind all of this - Darrin Wade!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3754727595" "{HeroName}! You're back, just in time! But wait, you say what you gotta say first, then I'll say what I've gotta say.<br><br>You found out who is behind all of this? Who? Who is it? ....<br><br>... Who? I've never heard of this Darrin Wade guy before. Is he supposed to be some sorta big shot? I mean, here I thought it was one of your big names, like Recluse or Requiem, heck I would've bought into it being someone from the Freakshow if you gave me a few drinks. But <i>Darrin Wade</i>? This guy sounds like a nobody!<br><br>But, then again, he clearly is aimin' to be a somebody if he actually is the mastermind behind everything that happened. I'll alert the FBSA and the Phalanx, but right now, <i>you</i> have some bigger issues to handle!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Psyche 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P548231212" "<color orange>You see Sister Psyche curled up on the ground, staring out into the distance. Looking around the area, it seems like this is her memory of the first Rikti invasion.</color><br><br>Can't... can't do anymore... can't shut out the screaming... the pain... did everything I could to stop the Rikti... losing control... losing my mind... went too far... all alone now... all... all alone..."
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P1640540862" "Can't... can't do anymore... can't shut out the screaming... the pain... did everything I could to stop the Rikti... losing control... losing my mind... went too far... all alone now... all... all alone..."
// Answer Text :
"P1400334892" "Snap out of it! You're not alone!"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3977306039" "Who... who are you? Not Manticore... not Synapse... not Positron..."
// Answer Text :
"P1544196245" "I'm {HeroName}, your new mental guardian, Malaise is trying to weaken you!"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P572122868" "Malaise... no hope... no hope...<br><br>Help will never come... the Rikti will destroy everything... I couldn't stop them... even with all my power...<br><br>All alone, in the end, the end coming to destroy..."
// Page InformationPage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P3431315179" "Malaise... no hope... no hope. Help will never come... the Rikti will destroy everything... I couldn't stop them... even with all my power. All alone, in the end, the end coming to destroy..."
// Answer Text :
"P3077482493" "You are NOT alone, snap out of it! Look at me!"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2411853880" "<color orange>Sister Psyche looks at you with dawning recognition on her face. You hear a loud explosion in the distance - someone's here!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3997909506" "Malaise!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PsycheAsylum 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P918533090" "<color orange>A much different version of Sister Psyche stands before you. You realize that this must be one of her deepest fears, that everything she's experiencing isn't real, that it's all a massive hallucination.<br><br>Malaise has managed to drag Sister Psyche down into her worst fear. You'll have to somehow bring Sister Psyche back from the brink of destruction!</color><br><br>I'm sorry... {Hero.gender=male Mr. Daniels|Ms. Orosco}, I... I thought it was all real... I could've sworn."
// Answer Text :
"P2389717474" "It is real! Remember the Freedom Phalanx, you're part of them!"
// Answer Text :
"P3699089211" "Remember your husband, Manticore. It was all real!"
// Answer Text :
"P4282223610" "-I'm- real, I'm {HeroName}, and this is all a trick by Malaise!"
// Page MainDoubt Text :
"P1619086412" "I don't know... isn't this real? The other world I thought I was in... it was all too crazy, too unbelievable to be true."
// Answer Text :
"P2605693516" "Remember the Freedom Phalanx, you're part of them!"
// Answer Text :
"P1232472486" "Remember your husband, Manticore!"
// Page PsycheFree Text :
"P3416729595" "You're right... This isn't real! My LIFE outside is real!"
// Answer Text :
"P1324965546" "You remember!"
// Page Wrong Text :
"P3239658113" "No... no, none of that is right...!"
// Answer Text :
"P3166235747" "Listen!"
// Page Doubt1 Text :
"P2432833856" "I don't... the Freedom Phalanx... it seems so familiar... but then they feel so distant...<br><br>I can barely remember their faces, the ones who were all in there. I think of them, and their faces begin to vanish, as if waking up from a dream...<br><br>I don't even remember... the heart of the Phalanx... the one who helped get us all... get us all together..."
// Answer Text :
"P3817937133" "It was Positron."
// Answer Text :
"P241645186" "It was Statesman."
// Page Doubt1B Text :
"P1431767347" "Positron... I remember... he helped save me from those villains. He wanted... he wanted to reform the Phalanx in the 80's, to help fight crime on the streets of Paragon.<br><br>All of us scoffed at him, said it couldn't be done, but he won us all over, including Statesman. I... remember, but... was it real?"
// Answer Text :
"P2688909577" "It was real, you're seeing it!"
// Page Doubt2 Text :
"P733324952" "Manticore... Dr. Sinclair...? No, it was all just me... pushing some vivid daydream I had about the doctor into that reality. Manticore is a ridiculous name, I would've never... never been married to Sinclair.<br><br>But yet... something seems wrong about that. As if I was... but... it can't be true. I remember though, fights... we were fighting about something recently... I can't remember what it was..."
// Answer Text :
"P146843024" "It was probably about Ms. Liberty and working with her."
// Answer Text :
"P1325861263" "It was probably about Malaise and trying to redeem him."
// Page Doubt2B Text :
"P3048297792" "I remember... you're right! He said it was all for nothing, that he couldn't be redeemed. I yelled at him, said I wasn't a fool, that I could do it...<br><br>I was so angry, but only because his opinion matters to me. I wanted him to see what I saw, to feel the mercy that I... that I had. That mercy, though, it went away... it went away because..."
// Answer Text :
"P1888674316" "Because of what he's doing NOW! Wake up!"
// Page Doubt3 Text :
"P1971812398" "Malaise... I hear that name and I get angry, but I can't remember why. But when I hear {HeroName}... for some reason, I associate that with some sort of defender. Like, {HeroName} was a protector...<br><br>It doesn't make sense though, I don't have any sort of vast history with {HeroName}, but yet... I don't know.<br><br>Why would {HeroName} seem so close to me now, more than my own husband or my friends?"
// Answer Text :
"P3484255203" "Because I'm here trying to save your mind!"
// Answer Text :
"P1451225010" "Because of a link Aurora set up between the two of us."
// Page Doubt3B Text :
"P2559727283" "Yes... that's right. I remember yelling for you to help, it was all recent... seconds ago!<br><br>Trapped in my mind, trying to get out, no strength left to defend myself... <br><br>Then you appeared and attacked Malaise... attacked the Aurora inside of me...<br><br>You're not just a patient, you ARE {HeroName}!"
// Answer Text :
"P377703703" "That's right, you're remembering!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DrSinclair 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P192616299" "Please, {Hero.gender=male Mr.Daniels|Ms.Orosco}, head back to your room. Shalice needs her treatment. We'll make sure she stops calling you {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P29961748" "I am {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DrKeyes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P773036918" "This is no place for you to be, {Hero.gender=male Mr. Daniels|Ms. Orosco}. Ms. Tilman will need constant care to be nursed back to health."
// Answer Text :
"P3348613120" "I know what's going on here, Malaise! I'll stop this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DrArcanus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3848587844" "I'm terribly sorry for Ms. Tilman's outburst, {Hero.gender=male Mr. Daniels|Ms. Orosco}. We'll take good care of her, don't worry."
// Answer Text :
"P2052975709" "I'll break this, Malaise."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Longbow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4216550539" "We've got no time to lose, {HeroName}. Aurora is inside trying to keep a stable link up with Sister Psyche's mind.<br><br>It's going to be up to you to act as Sister Psyche's mental defenses and fight off all the attacks by Malaise and the Aurora that's inside of her mind."
// Answer Text :
"P2813255650" "Alright, send me in."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2425652609" "Sister Psyche's lapsed into a coma, {HeroName}. She and Aurora were fighting Malaise in her mind, and then she just... she just <i>collapsed</i>. Aurora had to push herself out of Psyche's mind before being trapped in there, but she said that Malaise and the Aurora trapped in there are running <i>wild</i> in Psyche's mind.<br><br>They're tearing Sister Psyche's mind <i>apart</i>, {HeroName}! Someone needs to stop them and save Sister Psyche's life!"
// AcceptString :
"P2403573705" "How? And what about Manticore?"
// SendOffString :
"P455022792" "Aurora said Manticore can't go in there. Psyche has too many memories associated with him, he's likely to get tossed up into the storm that's going on in her mind the minute he steps in. <i>You</i> have to be the one to go in there and stop whatever Malaise is doing.<br><br>Aurora Borealis can get you inside of Psyche's mind. From there, you need to help Sister Psyche get back into our reality. She needs someone to act as her guardian, her mind's new mental defender. If you can get Psyche back up to speed, she'll be able to force Malaise out of there and contain the fake Aurora once again. We've got a Longbow agent stationed nearby who can take you to Aurora and Psyche."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3767149635" "Save Sister Psyche's Life"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1720809372" "We don't have time, {HeroName}, Sister Psyche's life is hangin' by a thread!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1093446738" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: The Artist's Debut</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3967032074" "You're violently flung into Sister Psyche's mind, travelling through various passageways and tubes before you arrive in what seems to be the core of her mind."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P276528242" "Fight of Malaise and Aurora's manifestations"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1338173674" "Find Sister Psyche in her Rikti memory"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2011343611" "???"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1261233884" "<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Your death would mean nothing, {HeroName}, if you didn't come close to succeeding. Act 3!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3482247036" "<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Why can't you comprehend that this is OVER? Aurora WILL take over Sister Psyche's mind!<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>This is how it has to be, if not, then the entire story is ruined! What is a story without a good tragedy in it?!<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>I've come too far to let-"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1904247308" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>An unknown voice says, 'Ms. Tilman, please! You're making a mess of things, you have to come to your senses!'"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1836985310" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Mrs. Elliot does not like you calling her 'Swan', just because she owns one, Ms. Tilman."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1905912247" "<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>She's going to drag {Hero.gender=male Mr. Daniels|Ms. Orosco} further into her delusion. Administer the medication."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P309067737" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Ah! {HeroName}! Welcome to the grand show! I assume that Aurora dragged you into this?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P639204799" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Oh, you say stop, but what does the little piece of Aurora that you have TRAPPED in your mind say?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2626907813" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Lovely! Do you understand what is happening here, {HeroName}? This woman is not the same Aurora Borealis from the outside..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3314966309" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Heh heh..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3388901330" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>No, this is the portion of Aurora that has been trapped within Psyche's mind..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3292262397" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Ever since Psyche used her little mind riding ability to leap in and out of Aurora's body..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3118407438" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Ladies! Please, I'm trying to conduct a reasonable conversation with our antagonist..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P832601847" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Now, {HeroName}, let's see just how far you're willing to go to save Psyche!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2423081397" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>What?! This isn't... You're ruining the entire plot!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3101286154" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Yes! I knew I would still have my moment of glory!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2774732829" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>This will be my masterpiEAAAAAAAAAAAAAGHHH!!!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P659023708" "<color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Impressive! Let's see what our antagonist can do in the next part of our story!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4146447735" "Aurora Borealis?"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3551588802" "I say it's time to change things around, for Psyche to see how it feels to be kept prisoner in someone ELSE'S mind."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P163818060" "I had a brief bit of freedom once... but I've been trapped, all these years. In darkness... In -nothingness-."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3581860498" "Your little prison has made sure that I am QUITE different from Aurora, I assure you!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1935690649" "No matter, I might not have total control, but I AM free, Psyche! You can't put me back in that prison!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2903276487" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>MALAISE! Stop this, NOW!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2751447579" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>Malaise, you freak!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2526650609" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>You were a mistake! You're not real, and you're NOTHING like the real Aurora!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1697143287" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>MALAISE! I WILL NOT LET YOU GET AWAY WITH THIS!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2508460773" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I tried to help you..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3666000662" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I stood up for you..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P468453284" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I put myself on the LINE for you!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2929837056" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>NO MORE! You end HERE, Malaise! HERE AND NOW!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2598376254" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>It's up... to you now... {HeroName}... to stop... all of this..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1278492079" "<color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I can barely hold onto my mind, {HeroName}! You have to fight off these manifestations!"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_NAME :
"P1428349807" "Minor Image of Malaise"
// Script Variable ACTOR1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4248406821" "<shout>Let the grand finale begin!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_NAME :
"P3363351787" "Minor Image of Aurora"
// Script Variable ACTOR3_NAME :
"P773856771" "Image of Malaise"
// Script Variable ACTOR6_NAME :
"P2075029025" "Image of Aurora"
// Script Variable ACTOR7_NAME :
"P4271423956" "Major Image of Malaise"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3177773160" "Hello there."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2836457115" "Now you die!"

