// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P442697884" "<em point t=2 d=5><color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>Why did you bother to marry me then, if you don't want children?<t=8 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor CornflowerBlue>Please, you have to come to your senses. Dr. Sinclair is just trying to...<em angry t=10 d=5><color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>And the hours, -days- away? I can read your mind, Justin, even if you don't want me to!<em frustrated t=10 d=5><color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>Who are you kidding? With the way that -Swan- dresses?!<t=5 d=5><color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I should've known, marrying a billionare playboy. You could never change, could you?<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>ENOUGH! MALAISE! Stop this!<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Haha... THIS is one of your deepest fears? A husband that is disloyal? Or is it fear that you'll never have a child?<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSeaGreen>I swear, Malaise, I will have NO mercy on you when this is over!<t=7 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Oh, we'll see about that. In the meantime, the antagonist of my story is waiting! Come, {HeroName}, let us continue!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1158409747" "<t=5 d=5><em no t=10 d=10>Listen, Shalice. It's not that. It's just, it isn't the right time. We're both heroes...<t=10 d=5>I don't think of them in that way!<t=10 d=5>Shalice... you're right. There've... been a few, on the side. I've been meaning to tell you..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P368479866" "Swan"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2034674491" "Aurora"
