// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1448483136" "Shalice Tilman"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3972322322" "<t=5 d=5><t=25 d=5>What... what happened? Where am I? {HeroName}, why do you look so different?<t=25 d=5>No... But it was real! I remember all of it, I FELT all of it...!<t=5 d=5>I... I could've sworn..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P642818333" "<t=10 d=5>NO! This isn't REAL! {Hero.gender=male Mr. Daniels|Ms. Orosco} is called {HeroName}!<t=10 d=5>I know what's real, you can't change that!<t=5 d=5>I know what's real because I experienced it, because I REMEMBER my experience!<t=2 d=5>I remember my husband...<t=2 d=5>I remember my friends...<t=2 d=5>And I remember {HeroName}!<t=5 d=5>Now, GET OUT OF MY HEAD!"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1390848671" "Dr. Sinclair"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P686976786" "<t=15 d=5><t=35 d=5>You had another one of your episodes, Ms. Tilman.<t=5 d=5>You can leave now, {Hero.gender=male Mr. Daniels|Ms. Orosco}. We're sorry that Ms. Tilman interrupted your session."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3938044672" "<t=15 d=5><t=5 d=5>Please, Ms. Tilman, you're delusional, you don't know what's real anymore."
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1646660885" "Dr. Keyes"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1482907519" "<t=20 d=5>You gave us quite a scare there, Ms. Tilman.<t=15 d=5>The same as before, where you believe you are the world's most powerful psychic.<t=10 d=5>You regressed after the death of your mother, Ms. Tilman. You were trying to forget it all.<t=5 d=5>A reality that held an evil version of yourself, 'Mother Mayhem'. I feel we need to go deeper into that."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3201906329" "<t=5 d=5><t=5 d=5>{Hero.gender=male Mr. Daniels|Ms. Orosco}, what have you done?!"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1985679203" "Dr. Arcanus"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P725230492" "<t=10 d=5><t=15 d=5>Please, Ms. Tilman. {HeroName} is {Hero.gender=male Mr. Daniels|Ms. Orosco}.<t=15 d=5>And that you live in a city full of super heroes.<t=5 d=5>Dr. Cole reported you were talking about an 'alternate reality' within your own imaginary reality."

