// 3 Caption :
"P1021264113" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Some weeks before..."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P2848633458" "<t=6 d=6 em no>You do realize the danger you'll be in, going inside of Sister Psyche's mind."
// 4 Actor2 :
"P653047264" "<t=4 d=4 em laugh>Oh, I do."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P1210010733" "<t=6 d=6>If push comes to shove, she will kill you in there, you know."
// 3 Actor2 :
"P3776527291" "<t=3 d=3>Mr. Wade..."
// 3 Actor2 :
"P2394862892" "<t=5 d=5>A true artist is never appreciated until after his death."
// 3 Caption :
"P1153211361" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Present day..."
// 5 Actor6 :
"P2210890487" "<t=5 d=5>The doctors have confirmed that Malaise is dead. There's no coming back for him."
// 5 Actor5 :
"P1717224478" "<t=5 d=5 em no>We are still unable to locate Statesman."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P1800117315" "<t=5 d=5 em point>Well, Ray, looks like someone's gotta take charge. And you WERE the one who got us to re-form the Phalanx, back in the day."
// 5 Actor6 :
"P3428318644" "<t=5 d=5 em yourewelcome>Right, we need to split up. One team helps Manticore cure Psyche. The other finds Statesman and Darrin Wade."
// 5 Actor7 :
"P3437368411" "<t=5 d=5 em disagree>Statesman is going to go straight for Wade, when he finds out he's behind all of this.."
// 5 Actor6 :
"P314879319" "<t=5 d=5 em nod>Exactly. Numina, Synapse, and Citadel will help Manticore find a cure for Psyche. Brawler and I will look for Statesman."
// 5 Actor4 :
"P1872496744" "<t=5 d=5 em shrug>Seems a little uneven, don't you think?"
// 5 Actor6 :
"P122556451" "<t=5 d=5 em thanks>We'll have one more tagging along. {HeroName}."
